          "target": "urn:uuid:9a2b3c4d-e6f7-46d2-8def-123456789104",
          "rationale": "Patients with chest pain who are physiologically unstable and require immediate interventions such as intubation or hemodynamic support should be triaged as ESI level 1.",
          "citation": "Text states: Patients with chest pain who are physiologically unstable and require immediate lifesaving intervention, such as intubation... meet level-1 criteria.",
